{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/808062-romance-of-the-three-kingdoms","id":808062,"title":"Romance of the Three Kingdoms","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-13T11:12:16-08:00","id":808062,"title":"Romance of the Three Kingdoms","content":"Given that Romance of the Three Kingdoms is a 2e Changeling/Geist verison unknown cross over I thought it deserved a thread of its own.<br /> <br /> If I had to guess in it we might get the directional courts and maybe something on how 2e Changelings interact with the underworld and Geists (does a gravewrights powers work on them?)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T12:37:39-08:00","id":808142,"title":"","content":"Ooh, considering that the Directional Courts are territory-based anyway, maybe we'll see macro-scale Courts aligned with the warring Kingdoms themselves. The martial outlook of the Western Court might be a good fit for the Kingdom of Shu's aggressive (if ultimately doomed) campaigns against the numerically superior forces of Wei and Wu. The Eastern Court's connection with Envy might be reflected in the succession struggles and internal conflicts that plagued the Kingdom of Wu, and it's materialistic outlook might fit with the Kingdom's involvement in overseas trade. It would be even more of a stretch to connect the sate of Wei with the Northern Court in any way besides the Kingdom's geographical position in China, and I'm not sure where that would leave the Southern Court, exactly...<br /> <br /> Ok, so maybe that doesn't work. Perhaps they'll have a Freehold centered in Luoyang (or some other major political center), where the Directional Courts sort of play out the Romance in miniature. Maybe the influence of the Southern Court has waned as a result of the decline of the vibrant culture associated with the Han Dynasty, while the other Courts have somehow become entangled through the Wyrd with the fates of the Three Kingdoms. In that case, one would expect the Northern Court to wax in power over time, but maybe the Southern Court could launch a surprise comeback by somehow throwing in their lot with the ambitious Sima family, who eventually overthrow the Kingdom of Wei and found the Jin Dynasty.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3209-catdoom","name":"CatDoom","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"370"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T13:00:52-08:00","id":808154,"title":"","content":"In the land of Arcadia there is only one law.<br /> <br /> A single rule that all Gentry obey.<br /> <br /> No matter who you are... No matter what you are capable of...<br /> <br /> Do <i>not</i> pursue Lu Bu.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3738-illuminated-minutia","name":"Illuminated Minutia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3738_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"280"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T13:23:49-08:00","id":808176,"title":"","content":"Some of this presumes that the Directional Courts are in place. Which there's no guarentee of.<br /> <br /> I have no idea what's going on, hence my purpose is to say &quot;We know nothing about this setting&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T14:40:24-08:00","id":808242,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Illuminated Minutia</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/808062-romance-of-the-three-kingdoms?p=808154#post808154\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In the land of Arcadia there is only one law.<br /> <br /> A single rule that all Gentry obey.<br /> <br /> No matter who you are... No matter what you are capable of...<br /> <br /> Do <i>not</i> pursue Lu Bu.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ha! Now I want to do L\u00fc Bu as a Changeling... <br /> <br /> He was captured and brought before Cao Cao at the end of his career, but maybe he was snatched out of captivity and a fetch was hanged in his place. I would probably make him a Beast, both because of the whole captivity thing and because he seems to get compared to a Tiger a lot. He might better fit the mold of an Elemental, though, since he definitely seems to have had both the ego and the lack of perspective that are characteristic of people who fall into that Seeming.<br /> <br /> Maybe split the difference; Changeling L\u00fc Bu's mein could have tiger-like traits but also be made of fire or steel or something. That would be sweet. :P","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3209-catdoom","name":"CatDoom","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"370"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}